# Copy to .dev.vars (gitignored) for local `pnpm pages:dev`.
# This is a SERVER-SIDE secret read by the /api/scan Pages Function — it is
# never exposed to the browser. In production, set it as an encrypted
# environment variable in the Cloudflare Pages dashboard instead.
